{"id":"bruja","lemma":"bruja","pos":"noun","rank":1511,"glosses":["witch, sorceress (woman who practices witchcraft)","specifically, a Wiccan","crone, hag (ugly, evil-looking, or frightening old woman)"],"ipa":"/ˈbɾuxa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"brujas","masculine":"brujo","masculinePlural":"brujos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-bruja.wav","formAudio":{"brujo":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-brujo.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"No soy una bruja.","en":"I'm not a witch.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734363","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"La cacería de brujas ha comenzado.","en":"The witch hunt has begun.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"hunt, hunting"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to begin, to commence","l":"comenzar"}]},{"text":"Se pensaba que la mujer de extraña apariencia era una bruja.","en":"The strange-looking woman was thought to be a witch.","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to think, ponder","l":"pensar"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"woman"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"China aster"},{"g":"appearance"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"¿Estás listo para la Noche de Brujas?","en":"Are you ready for Halloween?","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"clever, smart"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"night"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"La bruja le lanzó un hechizo al niño travieso.","en":"The witch cast a spell on the naughty boy.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to throw","l":"lanzar"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"magic word, spell"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"child, boy"},{"g":"naughty, mischievous"}]}]}